# Round six, item language (I3): closed-form cost coefficients

`CBH E = (aK K + 1) · Φ(E)` with `Φ(E) = 10^14 (E + 1)` on the chain levels `E < 2m` and
`Φ(E) = Cc E^θ + D0` on the node levels.  **`cbRec_of`**: `CBH` satisfies the cost recursion
`CBRec` when `τ ≤ θ`, the `θ`-moment `α = ∑_{children} (s/m)^θ < W` holds, `D0 = 10^14 (2m+1)`
and `Cc (W - α) ≥ nC D0 + 18 W' L 2^τ + C1` (`C1 = W' (L MH + CnN + 10^12)`).
